With the optional `cjk-fallback` Cargo feature, the build additionally
embeds assets fetched by scripts/fetch-cjk-assets.sh (not part of this
repository): Noto Sans JP Regular (OFL-1.1) and the Adobe CMap and
mapping resources (BSD-3-Clause). Their licence files are fetched
alongside and must accompany any binary built with that feature.

Third-party Rust crates and their licences are listed in
docs/third-party.md.
